   <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight">More Than an Ambulance.<br><span class="text-teal1">A Smarter Care Journey.</span></h2>
   <p class="mt-4 text-ink2 text-lg">Emergency care is not just about reaching the hospital. The right information and preparation can help the receiving team get ready earlier.</p>
  </div>
  <div id="features" class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
   <article class="card reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-mint p-7"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white grid place-items-center text-teal1 mb-4"><i data-lucide="file-text"></i></div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Relevant Health History</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink2">Authorized healthcare professionals can access relevant patient information when it is needed for emergency care.</p></article>
   <article class="card reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-sgreen p-7"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white grid place-items-center text-teal1 mb-4"><i data-lucide="hospital"></i></div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Smart Hospital Coordination</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink2">Coordinate the incoming emergency with hospital capability, resources and readiness.</p></article>
   <article class="card reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-7"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-mint grid place-items-center text-teal1 mb-4"><i data-lucide="stethoscope"></i></div><h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Doctor Ready Before Arrival</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink2">Doctors receive relevant emergency information in advance so they can prepare before the patient arrives.</p></article>
